# Jarvis needs NO API key — the brain runs on your Claude Max plan via the `claude` CLI.
# This file just documents the OPTIONAL settings you can tweak (set them in your shell,
# e.g. `export JARVIS_WHISPER_MODEL=medium`, or your shell profile).

# Speech-to-text model size: tiny | base | small | medium  (default: small)
# Bigger = more accurate, slower. `medium` helps tough Portuguese audio.
# JARVIS_WHISPER_MODEL=small

# Force a speech backend: mlx (fast, Apple Silicon) | faster (CPU). Default: auto.
# JARVIS_STT=mlx

# Offline brain model (must be pulled in Ollama). Default: qwen2.5:7b
# JARVIS_OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b
